    "head_commit_message": "chore(ci): docs and Python-only changes skip the Godot suite and the sim checks\n\nA change to docs, specs, skills or the Python checks no longer waits on the gdUnit4\nsuite, the scaling check and the digests (#213 ran all of them for a Python script).\nneeds_godot.py decides by the files changed, not by the commit type; the CI wiring\nitself, game code, tests, content and the Rust core still run everything.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GQgzqqdjPY9H5H8VdRir2C",
